# test/ is otherwise a gitignored, per-user runtime data directory (see
# docs/quickstart-win.md) — these two are the exception: a checked-in demo
# dataset so a fresh clone works without any setup (operator password
# TEST-TEST-TEST-TEST, see docs/quickstart.md). They are the only two an
# installation cannot produce by itself: config.json has a documented
# default for every field, secrets.json is written empty on first start,
# and audit.db plus every *.db-wal/*.db-shm sidecar are runtime-generated.
!test/archive.db
!test/masterdata.enc
